---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_DESCRIPTION } from '../consts';

import '../styles/about.scss'
---

<BaseLayout title={SITE_TITLE + " | About"} description={SITE_DESCRIPTION}>
  <section class="about-section">

	<div class="intro">
		<h1>About Me</h1>
		
		<p>
			If you love Outer Wilds and/or Undertale, you probably 
			understand why I'm doing what I do. Games have already proven they can do unique and amazing things, and I'm trying my best to figure
			out if they can do anything more. Especially in educational contexts, I'm excited to see how games will change the ways we engage
			with the world around us and eachother.
		</p>
		<p>
			I'm the lead artist at <a href="https://lukko.digital" target="_blank">Lukko Digital</a>,
			where we're exploring these ideas now. Check out our <a href="https://lukko-digital.itch.io/bladebearer-recarved" target="_blank">latest project!</a>
		</p>
		<p>
			If you'd like to work with me, or recieve a sample of any of my projects, please reach out at any of my socials below, or shoot me an email at <b>joshuatehrlich@gmail.com</b>
		</p>
	</div>

	<div class="education">
		<h2 id="education-heading">Education</h2>
		<p>Bachelor of Fine Arts in Illustration from the Rhode Island School of Design, Fall 2025</p>
	</div>
	<div class="experience">
		<h2 id="experience-heading">Experience</h2>
		<p>Lead designer and artist for DUST with Danielle Reynolds and DVC Games, coming 2026</p>
		<p>Art and Design Intern at Wise Wizard Games, 2025</p>
		<p>Artist for Name That! to be published by Wise Wizard Games in 2026</p>
		<p>Freelance graphic designer for Real Chemistry, 2024</p>
	</div>
	<div class="awards">
		<h2 id="Awards">Awards and Publications</h2>
		<p>Illustration West 63 Silver award, 2024</p>
		<p>Big Mode Game Jam 2025: Finalist</p>
		<p>Brackey's Game Jam 2024: 5th Overall</p>
		<p>A Beating Heart published by volume 1, Fall 2025</p>
	</div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>